<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?><tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"><ttm:name type="full">OneRepublic</ttm:name></ttm:agent><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters></songwriters><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">当我还是个城里的孩子</text><text for="L2">我只会跑 跑 跑</text><text for="L3">望向那闪烁迷人的霓虹</text><text for="L4">妈妈曾说 儿子</text><text for="L5">你终将成长 也终会老去</text><text for="L6">光是闪烁并不会变作金子</text><text for="L7">但在此之前 你只需纵情玩耍</text><text for="L8">孩子 纵情奔跑吧</text><text for="L9">纵情奔跑</text><text for="L10">纵情奔跑</text><text for="L11">当我尚是个城里的孩子</text><text for="L12">我只会付出</text><text for="L13">上帝赐予我的每一分钱</text><text for="L14">我只会存上三四日</text><text for="L15">我的生活难免有跌宕起伏</text><text for="L16">老之将至前 我愿一往追寻好运</text><text for="L17">蓦然回首 忽觉我们也尝拥有的快乐</text><text for="L18">孩子 纵情奔跑吧</text><text for="L19">世人常告诫你天空也会塌下</text><text for="L20">世人常告诫你防范全盘皆失</text><text for="L21">因而我不断奔跑 直到世界尽头</text><text for="L22">我曾受教 依赖我的祝福</text><text for="L23">望向初升的太阳 逐日而去</text><text for="L24">有朝一日 天空或许会崩陷</text><text for="L25">有朝一日 我可能全盘尽失</text><text for="L26">因而我不断奔跑 直到世界尽头</text><text for="L27">若我曾受教 依赖过你的祝愿</text><text for="L28">我便会朝着初升的太阳 逐日而去</text><text for="L29">不断追逐奔跑</text><text for="L30">我并未实现我幻想的全部</text><text for="L31">但我仍然得到了我需要之物</text><text for="L32">我看到清晨的光芒</text><text for="L33">照耀于我</text><text for="L34">将我高升 又予我下沉</text><text for="L35">终止于那无人知晓的境地</text><text for="L36">但在此之前 让我们纵情寻欢</text><text for="L37">纵情奔跑</text><text for="L38">世人常告诫你天空也会塌下</text><text for="L39">世人常告诫你防范全盘皆失</text><text for="L40">因而我不断奔跑 直到世界尽头</text><text for="L41">我曾受教 依赖过你的祝愿</text><text for="L42">望向初升的太阳 逐日而去</text><text for="L43">有朝一日 天空或许会崩塌</text><text for="L44">有朝一日 我可能全盘尽失</text><text for="L45">因而我不断奔跑 直到世界尽头</text><text for="L46">若我曾受教 悉数过你的祝愿</text><text for="L47">我便会朝着初升的太阳 逐日而去</text><text for="L48">不断追逐奔跑</text><text for="L49">不断追逐奔跑</text><text for="L50">我曾受教 悉数我的祝福</text><text for="L51">望向初升的太阳 不断追逐</text><text for="L52">我曾受教 悉数我的祝福</text><text for="L53">望向初升的太阳</text><text for="L54">我曾受教 悉数我的祝福</text><text for="L55">望向初升的太阳 不断追逐</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body><div itunes:song-part="Verse"><p begin="0:07.850" end="0:09.920" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:07.850" end="0:08.060">When</span> <span begin="0:08.060" end="0:08.120">I</span> <span begin="0:08.120" end="0:08.300">was</span> <span begin="0:08.300" end="0:08.390">a</span> <span begin="0:08.390" end="0:08.660">young</span> <span begin="0:08.660" end="0:08.930">boy</span> <span begin="0:08.930" end="0:09.200">living</span> <span begin="0:09.200" end="0:09.330">in</span> <span begin="0:09.330" end="0:09.420">the</span> <span begin="0:09.420" end="0:09.920">city</span></p><p begin="0:09.950" end="0:11.900" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:09.950" end="0:10.130">All</span> <span begin="0:10.130" end="0:10.190">I</span> <span begin="0:10.190" end="0:10.340">did</span> <span begin="0:10.340" end="0:10.520">was</span> <span begin="0:10.520" end="0:10.730">run</span><span begin="0:10.730" end="0:10.730">,</span> <span begin="0:10.730" end="0:10.970">run</span><span begin="0:10.970" end="0:10.970">,</span> <span begin="0:10.970" end="0:11.210">run</span><span begin="0:11.210" end="0:11.210">,</span> <span begin="0:11.210" end="0:11.480">run</span><span begin="0:11.480" end="0:11.480">,</span> <span begin="0:11.480" end="0:11.900">run</span></p><p begin="0:11.900" end="0:14.000" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:11.900" end="0:12.320">Staring</span> <span begin="0:12.320" end="0:12.410">at</span> <span begin="0:12.410" end="0:12.500">the</span> <span begin="0:12.500" end="0:12.800">li